# XR avatar view + locomotion + menu — protected

**User locked 2026-07-26.** Read `memory-bank/xr-avatar-view-locomotion-protected-state.md` before editing XR view, move, or in-headset menu.

## Invariants

| Area | Rule |
|------|------|
| XR spawn | First-frame `alignXrLocomotionRigToViewport` from `preXRCamera*` + live headset pose |
| Left X | Toggle view **always** (menu open or closed) |
| Stick click | Toggle Move **always** (menu open or closed) |
| Embody align | Rig **XZ + yaw only** — never Y |
| Disembody | Avatar at exit spot, face headset; viewer **1 m behind**; Move → **Viewpoint** |
| Yaw math | Parent-local; θ = `atan2(fx, fz)` (yaw 0 faces +Z in this tree) |
| Menu | Opaque; View/Move/Measure paired with status; grip-local forward+down on left controller |

## Forbidden without explicit user request

- Teleport avatar back to pre-embody spot on disembody
- Rig Y shifts on embody
- Leave Move: Avatar after switching to third person
- Require menu open for X or stick-click Move
- Float menu ~0.5 m ahead with no down offset

## Verify

```bash
bash scripts/verify_xr_avatar_view_locomotion.sh
```
